/** 1.30.0 / 2026-09-25 **/

[committer] Tagbirulmohoshin781

- Fix dynamic Tor system user UID detection (debian-tor, tor, _tor) to prevent stderr pollution and missing UID iptables errors.
- Fix critical clearnet recovery in stop(): ensure iptables reset and DNS/IPv6 restore even if Tor daemon crashed or is inactive.
- Add atomic startup rollback trap in start(): automatically roll back network rules if process is interrupted or Tor connection fails.
- Hardened data/torrc: bind TransPort, SocksPort, and DNSPort explicitly to 127.0.0.1 to eliminate external LAN exposure.
- Improve check_ip() with timeouts (--connect-timeout 8, --max-time 12) and reliable IPv4 validation across multiple privacy mirrors.
- Modernize check_status(): query Tor Project JSON API (/api/ip) with HTML fallback and remove redundant cat pipeline.
- Automatically create backup directory in setup_general() instead of aborting.
- Modernize Makefile with DESTDIR and PREFIX packaging standards, reinstall target, and test check target.
- Add .gitattributes (enforcing LF line endings for Linux bash scripts) and .gitignore.
